  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jen Jen Port (Jijel Port) Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at constructing a port include dredging of channels and basins, 2 break waters, 12 berths and two sheds, infrastructure (roads, water, power, telecom. etc), handling and navigational equipment and pilot boats, etc. The port will have handling capacity of 5.76 million tons per year.</narrative>
  </description>
